data Say11b bytes = 87, 73, 76, 76, 32, 84, 65, 75, 69, 32, 85, 83, 32, 72, 79, 77, 69, 46, 0

' Tiles 128-174: G0, G0, G0, G0, G1, G1, G1, G1, G2, G2, G2, G2, G3, G3, G3, G3, G4, G4, G4, G4, G5, G5, G5, G5, G6, G6, G6, G6, G7, G7, G7, G7, PegGood, PegNear, PegNone, BalTL, BalT, BalTR, BalL, BalBL, BalBR, BalB, BalR, Tail, Note, Hidden, Dot
